{
  "name": "bugsink-rs",
  "private": true,
  "description": "A private Rust rewrite of the [Bugsink](https://github.com/bugsink/bugsink) backend: Sentry-SDK-compatible error tracking on Postgres, serving a separately built client-side-rendered frontend.",
